{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"681b5a173916e28ae5f3b5c6bb5d16263b7d167f21a486ef3c62ed1ab29150f3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":51,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華說：",{"text":"「看啊，我要使毀滅的暴風襲擊巴比倫和住在立加米的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毀滅巴比倫人的日子一到，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要差遣外族人從四面八方攻擊他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從地上消滅他們，如同狂風捲走碎稭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要讓他們的弓箭手有機會射箭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要讓他們的戰士有機會穿鎧甲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要放過他們的青年，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要使他們全軍覆沒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們將被殺死在自己的土地上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"橫屍街頭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然以色列和猶大在他們的聖者面前充滿罪惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他們的上帝——萬軍之耶和華卻沒有撇棄他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"「離開巴比倫，各自逃命吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要讓她的罪惡連累你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致你們滅亡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為這是耶和華報應她的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華要懲罰她。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫在耶和華手中曾是灌醉天下的金杯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列國喝了她的酒，都變得癲狂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"轉瞬之間，巴比倫必崩潰毀滅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要為她哀悼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拿藥為她止痛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或許可以治好她。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"寄居在巴比倫的人說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『我們試過了，卻沒有治好。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們離開她，各自返回故鄉吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為她罪惡滔天，必受至高的審判。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華已為我們伸冤。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"來吧！我們要在錫安述說我們上帝耶和華的作為。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"「要磨尖箭頭，拿起盾牌！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華已激起瑪代諸王的敵意，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為祂決意要毀滅巴比倫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂要報仇，為祂的聖殿被毀報仇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要豎起旗幟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻打巴比倫的城牆；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要加強防衛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"派人巡邏，設下埋伏。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華言出必行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必按計劃懲罰巴比倫人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"住在河邊、擁有許多財寶的巴比倫人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的結局到了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的末日來了。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華憑自己起誓說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我要使敵人如蝗蟲一樣鋪天蓋地而來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"佔據你們的家園，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向你發出勝利的吶喊。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華以大能創造大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以智慧建立世界，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以聰明鋪展諸天。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂一聲令下，天上便大水澎湃；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂使雲從地極升起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使閃電在雨中劃過，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使風從祂的倉庫吹出。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人都愚昧無知，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"金匠都因所造的偶像而羞愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為神像是騙人的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它們沒有生命氣息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它們毫無價值，荒唐可笑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刑罰一到，必被毀滅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但雅各的上帝","poem":1},{"noteId":15},{"text":"截然不同，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為祂是萬物的創造者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列子民是祂的產業，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華是祂的名字。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"「巴比倫啊！你是我的錘子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我作戰的兵器，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要用你打碎列國，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毀滅列邦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要用你打碎戰馬和騎士，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打碎戰車和車夫，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打碎男人和婦女，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打碎老人和小孩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打碎少男和少女，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打碎牧人和牲畜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打碎農夫和耕牛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打碎省長和總督。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["耶和華說：「我要當著我子民的面報應巴比倫人",{"noteId":16},"，因為他們在錫安犯罪作惡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"text":"「毀滅整個大地的山岳——巴比倫啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我與你為敵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要伸手攻擊你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把你從懸崖上滾下去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你化為灰燼。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再無人用你的石頭做房角石或基石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要永遠荒涼。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"text":"「要在大地上豎起旌旗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在列國吹響號角，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓他們預備攻打巴比倫。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要召集亞拉臘、米尼、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞實基拿各國攻打她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要派遣將領率多如蝗蟲的騎兵攻打她。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要讓列國預備攻打巴比倫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要讓瑪代的諸王及其省長、總督和所統治的人預備攻打她。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地要顫抖，痛苦地扭動，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華決意要攻擊巴比倫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使她荒無人煙。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫的勇士不再作戰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"躲在堡壘裡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"士氣消沉，像婦女一樣無力；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫的房屋被火焚燒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城門被攻破。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"報信的人接踵而來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向巴比倫王稟告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『整座城已失守，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"渡口被佔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沼澤地被燒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"戰士驚慌失措。』」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":["以色列的上帝——萬軍之耶和華說：",{"text":"「巴比倫城要像麥場一樣被踏為平地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"收割她的時節很快就要到了。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":[{"text":"以色列人說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「巴比倫王尼布甲尼撒吞噬我們、擊垮我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把我們洗劫一空。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他像海怪一樣吞吃我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"飽餐我們的美物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然後把我們趕走。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"錫安的居民說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「巴比倫人殘暴地對待我們和我們的親人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願他們受報應。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷人說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「願迦勒底人償還我們的血債。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":36,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「看啊，我要為你們伸冤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"替你們報仇；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使巴比倫的江河枯竭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"泉源乾涸。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":37,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫必淪為廢墟，杳無人跡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"淪為豺狼出沒的地方，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"令人驚駭和嗤笑。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":38,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦勒底人像群獅一樣怒吼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像幼獅一樣咆哮。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":39,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們食慾大振時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要為他們設盛宴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們酩酊大醉，狂歡亂叫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"長眠不醒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":40,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把他們像羊羔、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公綿羊和公山羊一樣帶往宰殺之地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":41,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫","poem":1},{"noteId":17},{"text":"怎麼淪陷了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天下引以為傲的怎麼被攻佔了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫的下場讓列國恐懼！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":42,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"海水漲溢，漫過巴比倫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"洶湧的波濤淹沒了她。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":43,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的城邑淪為廢墟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"變成乾旱的沙漠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"荒無人煙，杳無人跡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":44,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要懲罰巴比倫的神明彼勒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使它吐出所吞噬的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬國必不再湧向它，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫的城牆必倒塌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":45,"content":[{"text":"「我的子民啊，你們要離開巴比倫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各自逃命，躲避耶和華的烈怒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":46,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"境內謠言四起時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們不要驚慌害怕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為今年傳這風聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"明年卻傳那風聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"說境內必有暴亂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"官長要互相殘殺。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":47,"content":[{"text":"「看啊，時候將到，我必懲罰巴比倫的神像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使巴比倫全國蒙羞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"屍橫遍野。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":48,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毀滅者要從北方前來攻擊巴比倫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時天地萬物都要因巴比倫的滅亡而歡呼。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":49,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比倫必因屠殺以色列人而倒斃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"正如各地因巴比倫屠殺而倒斃的人一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":50,"content":[{"text":"「刀下逃生的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們快走吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要停留！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在遠方要記住耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要追想耶路撒冷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":51,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們說外國人闖入耶和華殿的聖所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你們蒙羞受辱，滿臉盡是恥辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":52,"content":[{"text":"「看啊，時候將到，我要懲罰巴比倫的神像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使巴比倫到處都是受傷者的呻吟。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":53,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使巴比倫城高聳入雲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"堡壘堅不可摧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我仍要差遣毀滅者攻擊她。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":54,"content":[{"text":"「巴比倫傳出哭喊聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦勒底人之地響起大毀滅的聲音，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":55,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華正在毀滅巴比倫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要使城中的喧囂變成一片死寂。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毀滅者如怒海狂濤一樣湧來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不斷高聲吶喊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":56,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毀滅者正前來攻打巴比倫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"擒拿她的勇士，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"折斷他們的弓弩。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華是追討罪惡、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"報應惡人的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":57,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使她的首領、謀士、省長、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"總督和勇士都酩酊大醉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"長眠不醒。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是名為萬軍之耶和華的君王說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":58,"content":["萬軍之耶和華說：",{"text":"「巴比倫寬闊的城牆要被夷為平地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"高大的城門要被付之一炬，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列邦一切的辛勞都是徒然，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列國勞碌的成果都化為灰燼。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":59,"content":["耶利米先知把所有將要發生在巴比倫的災禍，就是有關巴比倫的事都寫在卷軸上。猶大王西底迦執政第四年，瑪西雅的孫子、尼利亞的兒子、宮廷總管西萊雅和猶大王一同前往巴比倫的時候，"]},{"type":"verse","number":61,"content":["耶利米對西萊雅說：「你到巴比倫後務要大聲宣讀這卷軸上的一切話，"]},{"type":"verse","number":62,"content":["並且要說，『耶和華啊！你曾說要毀滅這地方，使這裡人畜絕跡、永遠荒涼。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":63,"content":["讀完後，你要把卷軸綁在一塊石頭上，扔進幼發拉底河，"]},{"type":"verse","number":64,"content":["然後說，『耶和華降的災禍必使巴比倫像這卷軸一樣沉沒、永不復興，巴比倫人必滅亡。』」",{"lineBreak":true},{"lineBreak":true},"耶利米的話到此為止。"]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":15,"caller":"+","text":"「雅各的上帝」希伯來文是「雅各的產業」。","reference":{"chapter":51,"verse":19}},{"noteId":16,"caller":"+","text":"「巴比倫人」希伯來文是「巴比倫和迦勒底人」。","reference":{"chapter":51,"verse":24}},{"noteId":17,"caller":"+","text":"「巴比倫」希伯來文是「示沙克」，巴比倫的別名。","reference":{"chapter":51,"verse":41}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/51.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/52.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/50.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":63}